{"id":"vod_bf_16316","vodId":"16316","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"记录的地平线第一季","name_cn":"记录的地平线第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/df30ea04e414eaf3313afb7f6bcb073a.jpg"},"summary":"《幻境神话》是家喻户晓的网络游戏，在第十二次资料片更新之时，一场意外的发生竟然将三万名玩家困在了游戏构筑的虚拟世界之中。老牌玩家城惠（寺岛拓笃 配音）就是其中的一员，现实中个性内向的他在游戏里却极其富有领导才能，深受同伴的信赖和喜爱。　　恐惧和绝望笼罩在被困在游戏里的玩家的头顶上，个性开朗直爽大大咧咧的战士直继（前野智昭 配音）、拥有可爱外貌和强大实力的刺客晓（加藤英美里 配音）联同城惠站了出来，创立了工会“记录的地平线”，他们从大都市秋叶原开始出发，踏上冒险的旅途，决心开拓出属于他们的世界，找到脱出的方法。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:24:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiludedipingxiandiyiji/第13集